      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "EVANS.\nTrib, trib, fairies. Come, and remember your parts. Be pold, I pray you, follow me into the pit, and when I give the watch-’ords, do as I pid you. Come, come; trib, trib.",
